i-dark:#666666\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\">        return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> await</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> operation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"}]},{"heading":"Settlement: the first \"verified\" success","blocks":[{"kind":"p","text":"Once a worker reports the target found, the Manager broadcasts terminate to the rest and waits for acks — **graceful termination** cleans up resources before exiting; force only after timeout. Settlement must be idempotent (lock-protected): when two workers hit nearly simultaneously, only the first is accepted and the rest are ignored as duplicates. Failed workers are isolated; they never affect the others."}]},{"heading":"The structure, in one diagram","blocks":[{"kind":"diagram","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 96\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect x=\"6\" y=\"10\" rx=\"8\" width=\"70\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"41\" y=\"27\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">worker × N</text>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"31\" rx=\"8\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Message bus</text>\n<rect x=\"254\" y=\"31\" rx=\"8\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Manager</text>\n<path d=\"M76 28l44 10m84 8h40\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\".6\">First verified success → broadcast terminate → await acks → idempotent settle</text>\n</svg>"}]